uthor>\n<p id=\"As2W\">dissenting.</p>\n<p id=\"b848-12\">Adhering to my view that the death penalty is in all circumstances cruel and unusual punishment prohibited by the Eighth and Fourteenth Amendments, <em>Gregg </em>v. <em>Georgia, </em><span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"9426555\"><a href=\"/opinion/109532/gregg-v-georgia/#231\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Gregg v. Georgia\">428 U. S. 153, <page-number citation-index=\"1\" label=\"883\">*883</page-number>231</a></span> (1976), I would grant certiorari and vacate the death sentences in these cases.</p>\n</opinion>"}],"citations":[]}